  introText: "Mediation is a dispute-resolution method aimed at resolving a dispute systematically with the assistance of an impartial and independent third party. Under Turkish law, applying to a mediator before filing a lawsuit has been made a condition of filing in individual labor and commercial disputes. This arrangement aims to enable disputes to be resolved faster and at lower cost than through litigation. Where agreement is reached, the process can produce significant consequences for the parties.",
